      "content": "but that's just more weight. having to be \"the warmth\" and the \"investment\" is more pressure i can't handle. it just makes me feel more guilty because i'm failing at it. honestly, looking at it logically, it feels like the most compassionate thing would be to just... stop. to just let them move on without the struggle of me. it feels like the only way to actually help them is to get out of the way.",
